# Keep the RELEASE ZIP to what WoW actually loads.
#
# The zip is cut with `git archive`, which honours export-ignore, so anything
# marked here stays on the branch (GitHub Pages still serves docs/) but never
# lands in someone's Interface\AddOns folder.
#
# Measured at v0.84.0: the zip was 512 KB, and 347 KB of that was the Ash Tree
# planner page -- a web page the game cannot use, shipped to every installer.
# Neither docs/ nor tools/ appears in the .toc, so the addon loads none of it.
docs/       export-ignore
tools/      export-ignore
.gitattributes export-ignore

# The 3.3.5 client reads Lua as bytes; keep line endings stable in the repo.
*.lua text eol=lf
